# Files excluded from the packaged .vsix.
#
# IMPORTANT: node_modules is deliberately NOT excluded.
#
# `sqlite3` is a native module and both it and its `sqlite` promise wrapper are
# marked `external` in esbuild.js, so they are resolved from node_modules at
# runtime rather than bundled. The stdio gateway is spawned by the MCP *client*
# as a standalone Node process, so it must be able to `require("sqlite3")` from
# inside the installed extension directory. Excluding node_modules produces an
# extension that installs cleanly and then fails the moment a server is shielded.
#
# vsce already omits devDependencies, so only the two runtime deps ship.

# Sources — the bundles in dist/ are what actually run.
src/**
tests/**

# Build and tooling config
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.test.json
esbuild.js
jest.config.js
.github/**
.vscode/**
.gitignore
.vscodeignore

# Source maps roughly double the package size and are not useful to end users.
# Remove this line if you want stack traces from user reports to be readable.
dist/**/*.map

# Local artifacts
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.bak
**/.DS_Store

# Documentation kept in the package: README and LICENSE are shown on the
# Marketplace page, so they are intentionally not ignored here.
docs/PRESENTATION.md
